Enables/disables the Earth-curvature-and-refraction correction

SYNOPSIS

    h.set_curvature(True, refraction_k = 0.13)

DESCRIPTION

Mirrors horizonator_set_curvature() in horizonator.h. When
curvature_enabled is False (the default), rendering uses the original
flat tangent-plane approximation, unchanged. refraction_k is the
atmospheric refraction coefficient (0.13 is a commonly-used value; see
udeuschle.de); ignored when curvature_enabled is False.

ARGUMENTS

- curvature_enabled: boolean

- refraction_k: optional float, defaulting to 0.13

RETURNED VALUES

None. Raises an exception on failure.
